/target

# Working journal and tuning artefacts. Kept on disk, out of version control:
# they are scratch output of a measurement run, not part of the engine, and
# they go stale the moment the next run starts.
#
# They used to be ignored for a second reason -- that they named the reference
# engines used for measurement -- and that reason is void. Those names are now
# in NOTICES.md on purpose: naming what you read is what makes an independent
# implementation checkable, and hiding it achieved the opposite.
NOTAS_PROXIMA_SESSAO.md
dataset_*.epd
tuned_*.txt
tune_*.log
selfplay_*.log
resolvequiet.log
datagen_*.log
